  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::PlantData
  PlantName: Blue_Petunia
  PlantDescription: Like a piece of the evening heavens resting upon the earth, the
    Blue Petunia carries whispers of mystery and grace. Its sapphire petals unfold
    with quiet confidence, speaking of trust, inspiration, and unwavering devotion.
    In floriography, it is a bloom that invites the soul to dream, to wonder, and
    to believe in beauty beyond the horizon.
  PlantImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7e19b68c4a86f2d439f679da96e15f07, type: 3}
